% Shared bibliography for every manuscript in this repository.
%
% Merged from paper/references.bib (41 entries) and
% paper_nowcast/references.bib (47), which shared 24 keys. Two of those 24
% disagreed, and the disagreement was resolved by keeping the better entry
% rather than by picking a file:
%
%   akagi2011    - kept the nowcast version, which spells out the full author
%                  list instead of truncating to "and others".
%   mapspam2020  - kept the paper version, whose {{...}} braces keep the
%                  corporate author from being parsed as a surname by the
%                  author-year style.
%
% No entry here was written from a title or a DOI. tests/test_data_provenance.py
% enforces that an author-year string appearing in data/ resolves to an entry in
% this file or is declared informal, so inventing one to silence a check would
% defeat the guard it exists to be.
% ===========================================================================

